        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DECO-325 3-1/4\" Deco Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese decorative solid brass door stops screw onto the baseboard casement, wall or door bottom, to protect  the door hardware and wall.  The Art Deco door stops are hand finished by the master craftsmen at First Impressions International. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Not just  for decoration!</b> These Deco door stops are heavy duty 1 inch diameter base to with stand even large solid wood doors. Made in the USA. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Other \r\n<a href=\"/collections/decorative-door-stops\"><b>Decorative Door Stops by First Impressions</b></a>.\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions  DECO-325 Deco Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Screw Stud</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: White</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
